reviewer: claude-opus-5-5 (self-review)
audience: Technical leads and maintainers
purpose: How does the merge request gate find engsys when it is not on PATH?

Records the decision that the merge request gate is registered by the plugin hook catalog and finds engsys via ENGSYS_SYSTEM_ROOT, CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT, then PATH; supersedes only the registration file of ADR 0022.
Translated from Korean to English as a frozen record; the 2026-09-10 Windows non-blocking hook failure and its verbatim error output block are unchanged.
Headings mapped to Decision / Context and constraints / Rationale and alternatives / Consequences.
The quoted ADR 0019 rule is rendered in English to match ADR 0019's translated title; env vars, code block and commands kept verbatim; no Korean literals retained.

